          <p>Business applications are the operational backbone of every enterprise — ERP, finance, HR, supply chain, and customer-facing systems that must perform reliably, scale with demand, and integrate with emerging AI and cloud capabilities. Many MEA organisations are running application portfolios that have accumulated over years of acquisitions, custom builds, and vendor changes, resulting in complexity, cost, and rigidity.</p>
